<title>SOUTH KOREA: Inchon Steel 1996 net falls.</title>
<headline>Inchon Steel 1996 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					     13.48 vs 23.54</p>
<p>    Turnover				   1,510.93 vs 1,426.60</p>
<p>    Shr (won)					 888 vs 2,140</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			   16.59 vs 32.20</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>     common shares		  cash	   10 vs 12</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		     0.42 (loss) vs 0.88 (gain)</p>
<p>    Div Register					Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Payment				  from Mar 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Inchon Iron and Steel Co Ltd's share capital increased 0.5 million to 1.6 million in 1996 due to rights and bonus offerings.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5649</p>
</text>
